# What the restart actually loaded

- Router pid 49032 ran
  C:\Users\djlov\.local\share\ciel-runtime\ciel_runtime.py serve and reported
  0.2.51-nightly.20261022-030938.625faed, provider alitoken, model
  ciel-runtime-alitoken-deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017.
- That directory held none of the five fixes; the earlier npm global install
  is not the path this launcher executes. The launcher resolves
  CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME, else ~/.local/share/ciel-runtime (ciel-runtime.cmd).

# What was changed

The 11 Python files carrying the working-tree fixes were copied from
C:\Users\djlov\ciel-runtime into ~/.local/share/ciel-runtime, each with a
.bak-20261022-002214 backup. Commit 625faed changed only context_compaction.py
(plus its docs and test), which was left untouched, so both its
truncated-summary retry and these fixes are present. Stale bytecode for the
copied modules was removed.

# Version string

runtime_constants.VERSION still reads nightly.625faed; it is not stamped by a
local copy, so the running build must be identified by process start time
compared with the copied files' mtimes, not by /health version.

# Live vision result on the previous build

evidence/live-vision-probe.txt: with the still-running 625faed build, the
alitoken deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 model answered "Red" for a red image on the
Anthropic wire and "Blue" for a blue image on the Chat wire. Image input
already worked on those paths; the fixes cover the Ollama wire, the Codex
catalog modality, the accepted-stream timeout and the feedback menu.

# Pending

A restart is required to load the copied modules into the running router.
